  "description": "Renewable-energy potential scenarios for Germany, published by Risch et al. Includes onshore and offshore wind, rooftop and open-field photovoltaics, agrivoltaics, floating photovoltaics and parking photovoltaics. The 120 original CSV files contain capacity placements and plant parameters, orientation-specific rooftop capacities, and area/capacity summaries. Aggregation levels include municipalities, NUTS3 regions, federal states, Germany and exclusive economic zones; coverage varies by technology. The original technology/scenario/aggregation directory structure is retained.",
